{"id":"extre_me","lemma":"extrême","pos":"adj","rank":3230,"glosses":["extreme"],"ipa":"/ɛk.stʁɛm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/61/Fr-extr%C3%AAme.ogg/Fr-extr%C3%AAme.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"extrêmes"},"formAudio":{"extrêmes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-extr%C3%AAmes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ce sont les cas extrêmes.","en":"They are the extreme cases.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"case, situation"},null]},{"text":"C'est un peu extrême.","en":"It's a bit extreme.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"Il s'agit des cas extrêmes.","en":"They are the extreme cases.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to act, to do","l":"agir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"case, situation"},null]},{"text":"Sa façon de penser est un peu extrême.","en":"His way of thinking is a bit extreme.","words":[{"g":"his"},{"g":"way"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to think"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"N'est-ce pas un tantinet extrême ?","en":"Is it not a bit extreme?","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bit, tad"},null]}]}